<html><body><h1>Harbor Lights opens its Denver roastery</h1><p>Harbor Lights Coffee opened its third roastery in Denver on Tuesday, bringing the company to <b>71 employees</b> across Portland, Austin and Denver. The Mountain region, run by Priya Raman, now accounts for 40 percent of wholesale accounts.</p><p>Also this week: the <a href="https://harborlights.example/shipping">shipping policy</a> changes on December 1 (free over $40), and Dr. Hana Sato's wellness programme adds a second clinic day.</p><img src="https://harborlights.example/t.gif" width="1" height="1"><p>&mdash; The Harbor Lights team</p></body></html>
